Implementation result
- Replaced the prototype-bearing legacy digest record with a ReadonlyMap and
  used own-entry-safe has/get lookups. Arbitrary schema-v1 ticket IDs now
  produce deterministic legacy_schema_forbidden diagnostics instead of
  reaching inherited Object properties or throwing.
- Replaced the literal eval regex with a bounded Deno-prefix detector. It
  normalizes single and double quote characters inside each whitespace token,
  recognizes deno and deno.exe, skips only supported leading Deno global flags,
  consumes the separate value of --config and --log-level, and examines only
  the first remaining token as the subcommand.
- The detector rejects only eval in subcommand position. Legitimate check,
  test, and run definitions containing later eval arguments remain accepted,
  including a separate --config value named eval. Task text is never executed
  or generally shell-parsed.

